            <ArticleTitle>[The uretheral syndrome in men or prostatodynia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>373-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Based on the results of the clinical and urodynamic investigation of 15 patients, presenting with functional genitourinary symptoms, the authors report the efficacy of treatment with alpha-blockers. They stress the importance of the clinical history and of static sphincterometry in this type of patient.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
